  "description": "And, what is Relative Strength?! (NOT RSI 🙄)",
  "body_html": "<p>Silver continues to move upwards. Does it look expensive? Heck yea! I am a human just like you. But a pricey asset can always get way more pricey…and we follow the trend! If you didn’t see my post yesterday, a <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buying-this-stock\">Silver Mining Company I purchased</a>… that is actually profitable, check that out.</p><p>Are you aware of what <strong>relative strength</strong> is? No, not relative strength index (RSI)… a largely useless indicator; and yes, I have used in the past but abandoned it years ago when I discovered that practically no great investor uses it. I do think it has value in regards to triple divergences…but that is for another time. Relative strength is how well an asset is moving, in comparison to other assets, namely, the S&amp;P 500. </p><p>A rudimentary example, lets say we have 3 stocks:</p><ul><li><p>Stock A moved up +7%</p></li><li><p>Stock B moved up +3%</p></li><li><p>S&amp;P 500 moved up +3%</p></li></ul><p>Stock A will have a higher relative strength score, because it is moving upwards more rapidly than both Stock B and the S&amp;P 500. Stock B will have a relative strength score equal to the S&amp;P 500 in this example. </p><p>The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a> actually measures stock performance not only against the S&amp;P 500, but all 5000+ stocks it evaluates. It ranks each stock against each other. We want stocks that are moving up! Not going sideways, underperforming, or worse, declining!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png\" width=\"566\" height=\"176\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:176,&quot;width&quot;:566,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:64170,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/181327433?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!25Fh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa3e49717-dac5-447c-9d7e-4feeb2c8bacd_566x176.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Short term relative strength is measured in days, long term is measured in weeks/months. These stocks are outperforming their peers…and trend is friend!</figcaption></figure></div><p>If you would like a similar relative strength indicator for your tradingview charts, feel free to add this: “<a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/v/D62aWpQ5/\">Tim’s Pump Machine</a>” to your charts. Click the link, add to favorites, and then it will appear in your indicators tab. This tool is a less robust than the screener, however is still valuable information. It only measures asset strength against the S&amp;P 500, and measures the stock’s performance over the last year.</p><p>The reason I bring this up, is we are consistently seeing silver (and the silver stock I picked up) move upwards. Silver is vastly outperforming the S&amp;P 500, along with the associated miners. Trend is friend!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png\" width=\"833\" height=\"295\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:295,&quot;width&quot;:833,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:147476,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/181327433?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dcxg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe45ad31a-6add-4d09-b4ff-9e4ec7529ae4_833x295.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Netflix is a stock I have beaten up publicly. It continues to UNDERPERFORM the market, with no clear end in sight. Why buy something like this?! Make no sense.  </figcaption></figure></div><p>Primary point: buy strength. You will find yourself in winning positions far more often. If you have questions, feel free to ping me in the main chat, linked below!</p><h4><strong>If you actually liked this video, please do leave a like and re-stack. </strong></h4><h4><em><strong>If you didn’t like it, leave a hate comment down below</strong></em><strong> 😂</strong></h4><p>Hope you have a great day, and THANKS FOR STOPPING BY! 👍</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
